From 727f71196e5da12d9aba03091e030530a4a9e440 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PanVK WSI Debug <debug@localhost>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:06:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] anland: present shared staging buffers through Android Vulkan

Negotiate GPU staging and exchange render and release SYNC_FDs so Android can sample the shared DMA-BUF into its own swapchain. Fall back to EGL with a fresh allocation when negotiation fails.

Report actual presentation timing and refresh-rate changes independently of buffer release.

Companion Mesa commit: 3be654701a9c11f3d5ba15bc049f548068960f2e.
